guide forever/reputation/hydraxian-waterlords
title Hydraxian Waterlords Reputation
category Reputation
folder Reputation · Raids and dungeons
levels 60-60
zone Azshara
keywords Hydraxian Waterlords, Duke Hydraxis, Aqual Quintessence, Eternal Quintessence, Molten Core, Majordomo Executus, Ragnaros, Dust Stormer, Desert Rumbler, Pyroguard Emberseer, Eye of the Emberseer, Hands of the Enemy, A Hero's Reward, Ocean's Breeze, Tidal Loop, fire resistance, Lothos Riftwaker, attunement
why Aqual Quintessence to douse the Molten Core's runes, the reusable Eternal Quintessence at Revered and a fire resistance ring.
reward item 22754
reward item 17333
reward item 18399 18398

# Built from Forever's data: Duke Hydraxis's chain (Poisoned Water 6804 and Stormers and Rumblers 6805,
# both needed for Eye of the Emberseer 6821, then The Molten Core 6822, Agent of Hydraxis 6823 at
# Honored, Hands of the Enemy 6824 and A Hero's Reward 7486), the reputation per quest from Forever's quest
# pages (only A Hero's Reward pays the Waterlords: 200), the kill reputation of the world database with
# the last standing each kill counts in, the Molten Core's spawn counts, and Duke Hydraxis's gossip
# conditions (Aqual Quintessence once Hands of the Enemy is done and you are Honored, Eternal Quintessence
# at Revered). Neutral to Exalted is 42,000 reputation.
# Kill reputation: Dust Stormers, Desert Rumblers and Greater Obsidian Elementals 5 (count through
# Friendly); Huricanian 25, Lord Incendius 15, Pyroguard Emberseer 50 and the Molten Core's elementals 20 or
# 40 (count through Honored); seven Molten Core bosses 100 (count through Revered, so they never make you
# Exalted); Golemagg the Incinerator 150 and Ragnaros 200 (count to the end).
# Where a kill's last standing ends: Classic players stop at the top of it (5,999 of 6,000 Friendly for the
# Silithus elementals, 20,999 of 21,000 Revered for the seven bosses), so the next standing always needs a
# mob that still counts there. The guide is written that way; it holds if Forever lets a kill tip over too.
# The trash total per clear (3,360) is the sum over the Molten Core's spawns in the world database, not a
# measured run.
# Raid and dungeon content is optional here: Upper Blackrock Spire and the Molten Core need groups.
# Left out: the client item table ties Plans: Icebane Bracers (22705) and Enchanted Sigil: Flowing Waters
# (228979) to the Waterlords at Revered, but no vendor in Forever's data sells them and Duke Hydraxis is no
# vendor.
# INGAME: Does anyone sell Plans: Icebane Bracers or Enchanted Sigil: Flowing Waters for Waterlords standing?
# INGAME: Is the Molten Core open? Blizzard's raid announcement for Forever names Barrow Deeps, Hyjal Summit
# and Onyxia's Lair; the Molten Core is in the client but not announced. Until it opens the Waterlords stop
# at Honored (Lord Incendius, Pyroguard Emberseer and Huricanian count until then).

step Duke Hydraxis
  tip Duke Hydraxis stands on a small island off the east coast of Azshara; swim out to him. Everyone starts Neutral with the Waterlords, and nearly all of their reputation comes from killing the servants of fire, air and earth: the quests themselves pay nothing until the last one. Take both quests: the chain goes on only when both are done. Everything past Honored happens in the Molten Core, a raid of 40 that is not among the first raids Blizzard has announced for Forever; until it opens, Honored is as far as the Waterlords go. The numbers in this guide leave out the Legacy perk Diplomat, which adds up to 10%.
  accept 6804
  accept 6805

step Stormers and Rumblers
  zone Silithus
  tip Dust Stormers and Desert Rumblers drift around the Crystal Vale in the north-west of Silithus. Each kill also pays 5 reputation while you are Neutral or Friendly, so stay if you mean to farm (next steps).
  kill 11744 x15 quest 6805.1         -- Dust Stormer
  kill 11746 x15 quest 6805.2         -- Desert Rumbler

step Poisoned Water
  zone Eastern Plaguelands
  tip Use the Aspect of Neptulon on a Blighted Horror or a Plague Monstrosity: it turns into a Discordant Surge. Kill the surge and loot its Discordant Bracers. Twelve are needed, and the vial must still be in your bags at the turn-in.
  use 17310 optional @44.0,41.0       -- Aspect of Neptulon, on the poisoned elementals
  collect 17309 x12 quest 6804.1      -- Discordant Bracers

step Back to Duke Hydraxis
  zone Azshara
  turnin 6804
  turnin 6805
  accept 6821

step Eye of the Emberseer
  zone Burning Steppes
  tip Pyroguard Emberseer is a boss in Upper Blackrock Spire, inside Blackrock Mountain: a group of up to ten, and someone needs the Seal of Ascension to open the door. He drops the Eye and pays 50 reputation per kill up to 11,999 of 12,000 Honored. Lord Incendius in Blackrock Depths pays 15 the same way.
  collect 17322 quest 6821.1 optional @26.4,24.5 -- Eye of the Emberseer: raid of ten
  turnin 6821 optional
  accept 6822 optional

step Attunement to the Core
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip Lothos Riftwaker in Blackrock Mountain attunes you to the Molten Core: bring him a Core Fragment from beside the Molten Core's portal at the bottom of Blackrock Depths. Once attuned, he can send you straight into the Molten Core.
  accept 7848 optional map 1428
  collect 18412 quest 7848.1 optional @32.1,94.7 -- Core Fragment, at the portal in Blackrock Depths
  turnin 7848 optional map 1428

step The Molten Core
  tip The Molten Core is a raid of 40. Kill one Molten Giant, Firelord, Ancient Core Hound and Lava Surger for Duke Hydraxis. Every elemental there pays: Firewalkers, Flameguards, Lava Elementals, Lava Reavers and Molten Destroyers 40, Firelords, Lava Surgers, Molten Giants and Ancient Core Hounds 20, up to 11,999 of 12,000 Honored; about 3,360 for a full clear of the trash. The bosses pay 100 each (Golemagg 150, Ragnaros 200).
  kill 11658 quest 6822.1 optional @32.1,94.7 -- Molten Giant: raid of 40
  kill 11668 quest 6822.2 optional @32.1,94.7 -- Firelord
  kill 11673 quest 6822.3 optional @32.1,94.7 -- Ancient Core Hound
  kill 12101 quest 6822.4 optional @32.1,94.7 -- Lava Surger

step Elementals to Honored
  zone Silithus
  tip Neutral to Honored is 9,000 reputation, and Agent of Hydraxis asks for Honored. One Molten Core clear pays about 4,000 of it. Without a raid it comes from the elementals: 5 per Dust Stormer, Desert Rumbler or Greater Obsidian Elemental (the Burning Steppes), about 1,800 kills from Neutral. They stop at 5,999 of 6,000 Friendly, one point short, so the last point needs a kill that still counts there: Huricanian, a rare air elemental in the Crystal Vale (25), or Lord Incendius at the Black Anvil in Blackrock Depths (15, a five-player dungeon). Those two and Pyroguard Emberseer keep paying through Honored as well.
  kill 11744 optional                 -- Dust Stormer, 5
  kill 11746 optional                 -- Desert Rumbler, 5
  kill 14478 optional                 -- Huricanian, rare, 25
  kill 9017 optional @32.1,94.7 map 1427 -- Lord Incendius, Blackrock Depths: 15, group up
  rep 749 Honored

step Agent of Hydraxis
  zone Azshara
  tip Back to Duke Hydraxis. Agent of Hydraxis is done the moment you are Honored.
  turnin 6822 optional
  accept 6823 optional
  turnin 6823 optional
  accept 6824 optional

step Hands of the Enemy
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip Lucifron, Gehennas, Shazzrah and Sulfuron Harbinger are Molten Core bosses: each drops his hand for the quest.
  collect 17332 quest 6824.1 optional @32.1,94.7 -- Hand of Shazzrah: raid of 40
  collect 17329 quest 6824.2 optional @32.1,94.7 -- Hand of Lucifron
  collect 17331 quest 6824.3 optional @32.1,94.7 -- Hand of Gehennas
  collect 17330 quest 6824.4 optional @32.1,94.7 -- Hand of Sulfuron

step A Hero's Reward
  zone Azshara
  tip Hand in the hands, then dive under the surf at the southern foot of the island: Hydraxis' Coffer holds your ring and pays the only quest reputation the Waterlords give, 200. From now on, while you are Honored or better, the Duke hands you Aqual Quintessence: pour it on a rune in the Molten Core to douse it. With every rune doused, Majordomo Executus comes out, and after him Ragnaros.
  turnin 6824 optional
  accept 7486 optional
  turnin 7486 optional choose 18399 18398
  collect 17333 npc 13278 optional    -- Aqual Quintessence, ask the Duke

step Molten Core to Revered
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip Honored to Revered is 12,000 reputation. The trash still counts, so a full clear pays about 3,360 plus 700 from the seven bosses, 150 from Golemagg and 200 from Ragnaros: about three clears. Lord Incendius (15) and Pyroguard Emberseer (50) count too while you are Honored. The trash stops at 11,999 of 12,000 Honored; the bosses carry you over.
  kill 11666 optional @32.1,94.7      -- Firewalker, 40
  kill 11667 optional @32.1,94.7      -- Flameguard, 40
  kill 12076 optional @32.1,94.7      -- Lava Elemental, 40
  kill 12118 optional @32.1,94.7      -- Lucifron and the other bosses, 100: they carry you past 11,999
  kill 11988 optional @32.1,94.7      -- Golemagg the Incinerator, 150
  kill 11502 optional @32.1,94.7      -- Ragnaros, 200
  rep 749 Revered

step The Eternal Quintessence
  zone Azshara
  tip At Revered the Duke gives you the Eternal Quintessence: it does the Aqual Quintessence's work and is not used up, so you never come back for another vial.
  collect 22754 npc 13278 optional    -- Eternal Quintessence, ask the Duke

step Molten Core to Exalted
  zone Searing Gorge
  tip Revered to Exalted is 21,000 reputation. The trash has stopped, but all nine bosses still pay while you are Revered: 100 each from the seven, 150 from Golemagg and 200 from Ragnaros, 1,050 a clear: about 20 clears. The seven stop at 20,999 of 21,000 Revered, so the last point comes from Golemagg or Ragnaros, and from Exalted on only those two pay.
  kill 12118 optional @32.1,94.7      -- Lucifron, 100
  kill 11982 optional @32.1,94.7      -- Magmadar, 100
  kill 12259 optional @32.1,94.7      -- Gehennas, 100
  kill 12057 optional @32.1,94.7      -- Garr, 100
  kill 12056 optional @32.1,94.7      -- Baron Geddon, 100
  kill 12264 optional @32.1,94.7      -- Shazzrah, 100
  kill 12098 optional @32.1,94.7      -- Sulfuron Harbinger, 100
  kill 11988 optional @32.1,94.7      -- Golemagg the Incinerator, 150
  kill 11502 optional @32.1,94.7      -- Ragnaros, 200
  rep 749 Exalted
